==Sicilian==
{{wikipedia|lang=scn}}

===Alternative forms===
* {{alter|scn|eu|jeu}}
* {{alter|scn|jù|jò||possibly with external influence}}

===Etymology===
Variant of {{m|scn|[[eu]], [[jù]], [[jò]]}}, possibly due to influence of {{cog|it|io}}, both ultimately from {{inh|scn|VL.|eo}}, from {{inh|scn|la|ego}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|scn|/ˈi.ʊ/}} 
* {{hyphenation|scn|ì|u}}

===Pronoun===
{{head|scn|pronoun}}

# {{lb|scn|first person singular pronoun}} [[I]]
#: {{uxi|scn|'''iu''' sacciu lèggiri 'n sicilianu.|'''I''' can read Sicilian.}}

====Usage notes====
* In Sicilian speaking this pronoun can be postponed with respect to verb.
* In some dialects it can also become an emphasizing enclitic particle
*: {{usex|scn|'''Ju''' ci parrai-'''ju'''|'''I''' talked to him.}}

